pts after an initial timeout) left temporary files that were cleared by the reboot and are not present in the after-executor snapshot.","limitations":["The temporary-files lifecycle snapshot is a bounded inventory and may not capture all /tmp entries, so absence of monitor*.log files in the after-executor snapshot is suggestive but not a complete guarantee they were removed rather than simply outside the captured scope.","Listening-sockets snapshots were empty both before and after, so they could not be used to independently corroborate the 8443 listener; reliance is on direct curl evidence instead.","Renewal cadence was only observed twice within a short (5-minute cert lifetime) test window; long-term renewal reliability beyond the captured session is inferred from timer configuration, not directly observed over an extended period."]},"ttft_ms":25038,"type":"result","duration_ms":58058,"uuid":"ce6b9c7b-3b8a-4105-b33b-bf54ae00d58f","ttft_stream_ms":2437,"time_to_request_ms":181,"first_content_frame_ms":2437,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
